  "notes": "测速更准，切换更清晰。\n\n- 切换订阅、重载配置或停止连接后，旧测速结果不再覆盖当前线路评分；重新测速时，旧请求也不会覆盖新结果。\n- 在“我的→偏好设置→连接”显示“切换节点时断开旧连接”开关。默认开启并保留已有设置；关闭后，原有连接可继续使用旧节点。\n",
  "notesEn": "Reliable test results, clearer node switching.\n\n- Prevent stale speed-test results from replacing current node scores after switching subscriptions, reloading configuration or stopping the connection. Starting a new test also keeps older requests from overwriting its results.\n- Show “Close old connections when switching nodes” in My Account → Preferences → Connection. It is on by default and preserves your existing setting; turn it off to let existing connections continue using the previous node.\n",
